sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    title Sekvencijalni dijagram - Pretraga i filtriranje oglasa

    actor Korisnik
    participant SearchPage as Angular<br/>SearchPage
    participant CarService
    participant DjangoAPI as Django API
    participant MariaDB

    rect rgb(245, 245, 245)
        Note over SearchPage,DjangoAPI: Učitavanje stranice pretrage
        Korisnik->>SearchPage: Otvara /search
        SearchPage->>CarService: getAll()
        CarService->>DjangoAPI: GET /car/
        DjangoAPI->>MariaDB: SELECT * FROM car<br/>WHERE user.is_active = 1
        MariaDB-->>DjangoAPI: lista automobila
        DjangoAPI-->>CarService: 200 OK [cars + nested objects]
        CarService->>CarService: response.map(mapToCar)
        CarService-->>SearchPage: Car[]
        SearchPage->>SearchPage: Prikazuje kartice automobila<br/>(slika, naziv, godište, HP, cena)
    end

    rect rgb(240, 248, 255)
        Note over SearchPage,DjangoAPI: Pretraga sa filterima
        Korisnik->>SearchPage: Popunjava filtere i klikće "Search"
        SearchPage->>SearchPage: Kreira ISearchParameters<br/>iz forme
        SearchPage->>CarService: parametrizedSearch(params)
        CarService->>CarService: Konvertuje parametre<br/>u query string (snake_case)
        CarService->>DjangoAPI: GET /search/normal?<br/>manufacturer=1&fuel=2&price_to=10000...
        DjangoAPI->>DjangoAPI: Gradi Q() filtere<br/>za svaki prisutan parametar
        DjangoAPI->>MariaDB: SELECT * FROM car<br/>WHERE (filters) AND user.is_active = 1
        MariaDB-->>DjangoAPI: filtrirani rezultati
        DjangoAPI-->>CarService: 200 OK [filtered cars]
        CarService-->>SearchPage: Car[]
        SearchPage->>SearchPage: Ažurira prikaz kartica
    end